    "sections": {
        "description": "Oceanly Green is a clean and thoughtfully designed WordPress theme for blogs, news websites, online magazines, educational projects, galleries, portfolios, storytelling websites, and green businesses. With its nature-inspired color palette and content-focused layout, the theme provides an inviting reading experience while keeping important content front and center. The theme features a customizable header background with an integrated search form and a subtle parallax effect. Site branding can be displayed in a centered layout or positioned to the left or right to suit your preferred design. A standout feature is the dedicated Spotlight Posts section, which showcases featured content in an image-based grid. The spotlight area includes numerous customization options, allowing you to control image heights and choose which elements are displayed, including post titles, category labels, dates, and other post information. Overlay content can be shown, hidden, or displayed on hover for a cleaner presentation. Oceanly Green also includes an accessible multi-level dropdown menu, adaptable post grids with configurable minimum column widths and column heights, subtle post hover effects, sticky sidebar support, and four footer widget areas. Combining a customizable spotlight section, adaptable grid layouts, and practical publishing features, Oceanly Green provides a polished foundation for a wide variety of content-focused websites."
    },
